---
description: Verify CultureDAQ dev server after code changes
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

After substantive frontend changes (or when the user reports localhost issues):

1. Run `npm run dev:check` to verify http://localhost:3002 returns 200.
2. If check fails, restart with `npm run dev:clean` (kills port 3002, clears `.next`, starts dev).
3. Do not run `npm run build` while the dev server is running — it corrupts the `.next` cache.
4. After `npm run build`, always restart dev with `npm run dev:clean`.
